# Learn on a phone (390 x 844 at DPR 3) by finger: the setup list, the first
# lesson (three turns on the touch pad) to its results, then Home.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 600 Territory Trail
frames 60
save tt-phone-title
touch =Learn
until 300 Steer your trail
frames 20
save tt-phone-setup
touch Steer your trail
until 300 Steer your trail:
frames 220
save tt-phone-play
touch =Move up
frames 20
touch =Move left
frames 20
touch =Move down
until 600 Lesson complete
frames 30
save tt-phone-results
touch =Home
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
